File name: NQUEST1A.MP, NQUEST1B.MP
Path description: Here you have a complete path to take you through
   the first Neutral Quest!  NQUEST1A is the path for a single character.
   NQUEST1B will take a whole group through the quest, giving them all
   the 40k XP and the quest ring!
Path starts: Silvermere, Town Square
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Original Game and Module 1
Level recommendation: 20+ as an individual, varied in a group.
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: Because this path takes you all over the
   place, many monsters may be encountered.  Here's most of them:
	ankheg			bandit			brigand
	carrion crawler		dark goblin archer	dark monk
	displacer beast		forest spider		gnolls
	gorgon			half-ogre bodyguard	harpy
	manticore		mercenary		orcs
	mermex hunter		roc hatchling		thug
	umber hulk		wild dog
Additional information:

THINGS YOU SHOULD KNOW AND HEED!!

 - These paths are LOOPS.  You will find them in the loops section
   of MegaMud (press ALT-L).  They are configured to stop after one
   iteration, so you don't try to do the quest multiple times.

 - In order for the paths to work, you need to set your own character to
   accept commands (Options > Game Data > Players tab > click on
   your character).  Also, if you do the group quest, all of the group
   members need to be set to accept commands from you.

 - If you can't see well in the dark, you should bring at least a lantern,
   and light it before you go.  You may waste some lantern life, but it's
   a small price to pay.  Scripts tend to get confused with lighting, and
   you don't want the path to die in the middle somewhere.  It is almost
   1,000 steps, after all.

 - This quality path was brought to you by Wubbo (wubbo@wubbo.com)
   Comments, suggestions, or bug reports are welcome at that e-mail
   address.  Thanks, and enjoy the path!
